OL,3,GNEWSADriver who killed schoolboy, 12,
OL,4,Aand fled to Latvia jailed for more than
OL,5,Anine years
OL,6,
OL,7,FDolars, who has been jailed for more
OL,8,Fthan nine years, did not want to attend
OL,9,Fhis sentencing hearing, but the judge
OL,10,Fdemanded he be brought to court
OL,12,FHis name has been known publicly as
OL,13,FDolars Aleksanders, but the court has
OL,14,Fconfirmed Latvian officials say it is
OL,15,FAleksanders Dolars
